m pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$123.75/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.98.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Luminescent Mushroom is a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Mushrooms\" title=\"Mushrooms\">Mushroom</a> found underwater within an underground cave system below the Azure Fields. This cave lies beneath the cluster of small, interconnected islands characterized by blue-colored grass and surrounded by large formations of <a href=\"/wiki/Azurite\" title=\"Azurite\">Azurite</a> crystals, which also densely line the cave entrance and interior.\n</p><p>The Luminescent Mushroom is notable for its glowing cap and tall, slender stem, but it poses environmental hazards to those who approach it. When disturbed, it releases bubbles from beneath its cap that travel toward nearby players, causing the player to be launched upwards and be damaged while partially replenishing oxygen. Due to these conditions, harvesting Luminescent Mushrooms is considered hazardous and is typically undertaken using scooba equipment, such as a <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Scooba_Tank\" title=\"Rusty Scooba Tank\">Rusty Scooba Tank</a> or the more efficient <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Scooba_Tank\" title=\"Refined Scooba Tank\">Refined Scooba Tank</a>, particularly when gathering large quantities or transporting them by vehicle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>If the Luminescent Mushroom is hit once, it acts dormant and stops shooting bubbles. This can be very useful for grinding Luminescent Mushrooms.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Luminescent Mushroom (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6THVtaW5lc2NlbnRfTXVzaHJvb20/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Luminescent_Mushroom\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Luminescent_Mushroom?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" 